                                    <LONG-NAME TI="TI_1478558184">CDS Format</LONG-NAME>
                                    <DESC TI="TI_749505742">
                                    <p>The Length Byte for the Coding Data String.<br/>This DOP is used to calculate the 'flexible' length of the CodingString.<br/>The Byte value on the bus is converted to bits and 8Bytes==64bits are subtracted.</p>
                                    <p/>
                                    <p>Note that when setting the request Parameter, the lenght information must be the DataByteField length in bits</p>
                                    </DESC>
