                                <DESC TI="TI_1078154642">
                                    <p>      Parameter can be used to configure additional Job behaviour</p>
                                    <p>      A ";" separated list of flags</p>
                                    <p>      dryrun=true : No services execution. Only data parsing. Useful to data handling (Rules will be evaluated).</p>
                                    <p>      versioninfo=false : Disables the initial ReadVOD for VersionInfo to survive. Default is fslse.</p>
                                </DESC>
