                        <DESC TI="TI_1468533711">
                            <p>This Job returns a positive result also when there was programming coditions not OK.</p>
                            <p>The user can check the parameter PA_Resul. If that is 'correctResult' than the check was successful.</p>
                            <p>The PA_ResultDetai returns a comma separated list of single results</p>
                        </DESC>
